      "rationale": "P011 supplies the conditional instruction; P010 identifies the release slot and the intervention it would otherwise accommodate."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C020.signal_basis",
    "value": "Milestone events, preparation questions and repeated progress–waiting–return observations yield trajectory patterns, but the evidence does not distinguish an actionable constraint. Behavioral retention alone cannot identify a cause.",
    "scope": "The prospective onboarding cohort and the evidence condition triggering the measurement fallback.",
